<title>SINGAPORE: Brunei raises term price of Seria Light--traders.</title>
<headline>Brunei raises term price of Seria Light--traders.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brunei has raised the price of its benchmark Seria Light crude oil for term lifters in January to $26.75 per barrel from $25.25 in December, traders said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Brunei set the January price of Champion crude at $26.55 per barrel, versus $25.05 in December.</p>
<p>A provisional price of $24.50 was set for February Seria Light, and a provisional price of $24.30 for February Champion, the sources said.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
